TITLE Pyrite oxidation equilibrium in pure water with atmospheric O2
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7 charge
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g) -0.7 10
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 0
    Gypsum 0 0
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -si Pyrite Goethite Gypsum
    -pH true
    -totals Fe S Ca
END
